<title>USA: Outback Steakhouse buyback at 2.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Outback Steakhouse buyback at 2.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Outback Steakhouse Inc said Tuesday its board of directors had authorized a program to buy back up to 2.5 million common shares.  </p>
<p>The company said it would fund the program through available bank credit facilities, adding that the program would not affect future expansion plans.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said Outback had about 48 million shares outstanding, explaining that it was the first time that the company had adopted such a program.</p>
<p>Outback operates more than 400 steak and Italian restaurants.</p>
</text>
